  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1. 两个非零向量，如果它们的方向相同或相反，叫做**共线向量**. 如果两个向量中只要有一个是零向量，那么这两个向量也可以认为是共线的.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 64,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0071#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "有时从一个点出发作几个已知向量显得比较方便. 如图77, 是从点$O$出发作出了向量$\\vec{a}$, $\\vec{b}$, $\\vec{c}$: $\\vec{a}=\\overrightarrow{OA}$; $\\vec{b}=\\overrightarrow{OB}$; $\\vec{c}=\\overrightarrow{OC}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 64,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0071#13",
        "p0072#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-77",
      "label": "图 77",
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 77",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 77",
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-78",
      "label": "图 78",
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 78",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 78",
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果向量$\\vec{a}$, $\\vec{b}$, $\\vec{c}$共线(图78), 那么点$O$, $A$, $B$, $C$属于一条直线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**2. 定义. 向量$\\vec{a}$乘以数$x$的积, 如果数$x$是正数, 那么所得的积与向量$\\vec{a}$同方向; 如果数$x$是负数, 那么积与向量$\\vec{a}$反方向. 积的长度等于向量$\\vec{a}$的长度与数$x$的绝对值的乘积.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "向量$\\vec{a}$乘以数$x$的积用$x\\vec{a}$表示.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在图79上画出的是向量$\\vec{a}$和$3\\vec{a}$, $\\vec{b}$和$-\\frac{3}{2}\\vec{b}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在上述定义中没有研究当$\\vec{a}=\\vec{0}$或者$x=0$的情况. 对于这些情况补充如下:",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x\\vec{0}=\\vec{0}$, 对于任何的$x$;",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$0\\vec{a}=\\vec{0}$, 对于任何的$\\vec{a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-79",
      "label": "图 79",
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 79",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 79",
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们注意到, 对于任意的$x$和$\\vec{a}$, 向量$x\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{a}$共线, 而且$|x\\vec{a}|=|x|\\cdot|\\vec{a}|$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 65,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0072#15",
        "p0073#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "向量和数的乘法具有以下的性质:",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**1.** $x(y\\vec{a})=(xy)\\vec{a}$(结合律);",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**2.** $x\\vec{a}+y\\vec{a}=(x+y)\\vec{a}$(第一分配律);",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**3.** $x\\vec{a}+x\\vec{b}=x(\\vec{a}+\\vec{b})$(第二分配律).",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这些性质的证明可以从平面几何中得到.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "两个向量共线的条件可以利用向量的等式表示.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**定理10(共线性的判定). 非零向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$共线的充分必要条件是存在这样的数$x$, 满足于等式$\\vec{b}=x\\vec{a}$.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明. 1) **充分性.** 假设某个$x$满足等式: $\\vec{b}=x\\vec{a}$. 这时根据向量与数的乘积的定义, 向量$\\vec{b}$和$\\vec{a}$共线.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2) **必要性.** 假设向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$共线, 并且$\\vec{b}\\ne0$. 我们来求出这样的数$x$, 满足于等式$\\vec{b}=x\\vec{a}$(1). 为此, 研究比$|\\vec{b}|:|\\vec{a}|=k$. 由此得$|\\vec{b}|=k|\\vec{a}|$. 如果$\\vec{b}\\uparrow\\uparrow\\vec{a}$, 那么当$x=k$时满足(1). 如果$\\vec{b}\\uparrow\\downarrow\\vec{a}$, 则取$x=-k$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果$\\vec{b}=\\vec{0}$, 那么$x=0$. $\\blacksquare$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 66,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0073#11"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
